zstd_32: Zstandard, or zstd for short, is a real-time compression algorithm
zstd_32: providing high compression ratios. It offers a very wide range of
zstd_32: compression/speed trade-off, while being backed by a very fast
zstd_32: decoder. It also offers a special mode for small data, called
zstd_32: dictionary compression, and can create dictionaries from any sample
zstd_32: set.
